# Uldaros Theorix: "When Uldaros Theorix enters, if you cast him" - he was not cast. Bot1 Entombs Uldaros on turn 1 (Dark Ritual
# for the mana) and Reanimates him (losing 6 life, his mana value): he enters, but the ability does not trigger - no target is
# asked for (the refusal) and the Dark Ritual and Entomb in Bot1's graveyard are not exiled. The positive control is the
# neighbouring scenarios, where he is cast and the same graveyard cards are chosen.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Dark Ritual
Entomb
Reanimate
Swamp x3
Uldaros Theorix
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dark Ritual.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Entomb.Cast
Bot1.Search(Uldaros Theorix)
Bot1.Hand.Reanimate.Cast(Bot1.Graveyard.Uldaros Theorix)
! Bot1.Target
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Swamp; Uldaros Theorix
Bot1.Graveyard = Reanimate; Entomb; Dark Ritual
